p","q","r","s","t","u","v","w","x","y","z","a","b","c","d","e","f","g","h","i","j","k","l","m","n","o","p","q","r"],["f","g","h","i","j","k","l","m","n","o","p","q","r","s","t","u","v","w","x","y","z","a","b","c","d","e","f","g","h","i","j","k","l","m","n","o","p","q","r","s"],["g","h","i","j","k","l","m","n","o","p","q","r","s","t","u","v","w","x","y","z","a","b","c","d","e","f","g","h","i","j","k","l","m","n","o","p","q","r","s","t"],["h","i","j","k","l","m","n","o","p","q","r","s","t","u","v","w","x","y","z","a","b","c","d","e","f","g","h","i","j","k","l","m","n","o","p","q","r","s","t","u"],["i","j","k","l","m","n","o","p","q","r","s","t","u","v","w","x","y","z","a","b","c","d","e","f","g","h","i","j","k","l","m","n","o","p","q","r","s","t","u","v"],["j","k","l","m","n","o","p","q","r","s","t","u","v","w","x","y","z","a","b","c","d","e","f","g","h","i","j","k","l","m","n","o","p","q","r","s","t","u","v","w"],["k","l","m","n","o","p","q","r","s","t","u","v","w","x","y","z","a","b","c","d","e","f","g","h","i","j","k","l","m","n","o","p","q","r","s","t","u","v","w","x"],["l","m","n","o","p","q","r","s","t","u","v","w","x","y","z","a","b","c","d","e","f","g","h","i","j","k","l","m","n","o","p","q","r","s","t","u","v","w","x","y"],["m","n","o","p","q","r","s","t","u","v","w","x","y","z","a","b","c","d","e","f","g","h","i","j","k","l","m","n","o","p","q","r","s","t","u","v","w","x","y","z"],["n","o","p","q","r","s","t","u","v","w","x","y","z","a","b","c","d","e","f","g","h","i","j","k","l","m","n","o","p","q","r","s","t","u","v","w","x","y","z","a"]],"word":"zzz"},"output":false}],"solution":"class Solution:\n    def exist(self, board: List[List[str]], word: str) -> bool:\n        m, n = len(board), len(board[0])\n\n        def dfs(r: int, c: int, k: int) -> bool:\n            if k == len(word):\n                return True\n            if r < 0 or r >= m or c < 0 or c >= n or board[r][c] != word[k]:\n                return False\n            saved = board[r][c]\n            board[r][c] = \"#\"\n            found = (dfs(r + 1, c, k + 1) or dfs(r - 1, c, k + 1)\n                     or dfs(r, c + 1, k + 1) or dfs(r, c - 1, k + 1))\n            board[r][c] = saved\n            return found\n\n        return any(dfs(r, c, 0) for r in range(m) for c in range(n))\n","approach":"**Key insight: a path spelling the word is a depth-first search where the next character is the constraint, and the cell must be temporarily marked so the path never revisits it.**\n\n**Algorithm.** For every cell, call `dfs(r, c, 0)`. `dfs` succeeds when `k == len(word)`; fails when out of bounds or `board[r][c] != word[k]`; otherwise overwrites the cell with `#`, tries the four neighbours with `k + 1`, restores the letter, and returns whether any neighbour succeeded.\n\n**Why it works.** Every path of length `len(word)` that spells the word with distinct cells is explored by some sequence of recursive calls, and the sentinel prevents cycles. Restoring the cell is what allows a later start or a sibling branch to reuse it.\n\n**Common mistakes:** forgetting to restore the cell (later searches see `#`); checking the match after marking (then the mark is applied to non-matching cells); not short-circuiting with `or` so all four branches run even after success.\n\n**Interview follow-ups:** Many words on one board? (Word Search II: build a trie of the words and walk the board once per cell, pruning trie branches as words are found.) Cheap pre-checks? (compare letter frequencies of the word with the board; search from the rarer end of the word.) Worst-case board? (all identical letters with a word that fails at the last character is exponential, O(m * n * 3^L).)","complexity":{"time":"O(m * n * 3^L), L = len(word)","space":"O(L) recursion"},"similar":["word-search-ii","number-of-islands","palindrome-partitioning"],"number":98,"starter":"class Solution:\n    def exist(self, board: List[List[str]], word: str) -> bool:\n        pass\n"}